Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.89,0:00:03.23,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:06.88,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Krai, are all these relics yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:09.20,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's impressive how many you've collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.07,Flashback,Ansem,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.07,0:00:14.38,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,I've got a thing for relics, \Nso I just buy them whenever I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:15.83,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:19.92,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,You'll pick out one of these \Nrelics just for me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:22.21,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah. I did promise, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.16,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,No fair, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:25.94,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,He's going to pick one for all of us, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:29.71,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,It's finally paying off that \Nour leader is a hoarder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:33.84,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,It's about time I get my just rewards \Nfor being asked to charge them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:35.79,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,And I really am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:37.04,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:40.07,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,What's this relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:41.60,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.47,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,It's a Magic Bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.47,0:00:46.39,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,It can hold a lot more than it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:49.01,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,So, it can warp space?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.01,0:00:51.85,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,It's difficult to do that with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.23,0:00:54.02,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,Wasn't it expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.16,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Nope, it was super cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:57.98,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,It can only store chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:00:59.01,Flashback,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:00.36,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,Only chocolate...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:02.39,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,So, it's completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:06.13,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai! This bracelet is so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.13,0:01:07.62,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,That's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:12.96,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:18.36,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,That's a Labyrinth Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:23.16,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Putting it on completely messes up \Nall your spatial senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.16,0:01:25.49,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:29.83,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Usually, the confusion would cause\N your reflexes to tear your body apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:32.03,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,You're really something, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:37.55,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,This sword is the coolest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.55,0:01:39.11,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Wait, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:44.83,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,a cursed sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:49.65,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,I want to cut people to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:55.02,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,To shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.02,0:01:56.46,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.76,Flashback Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.29,0:01:57.88,Flashback,Ansem,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.39,0:02:00.71,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Let me cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.71,0:02:02.37,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Let me cut people!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:06.41,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, that sword usually makes people \Ncompletely lose their minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:08.88,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,but it's crazy that he's \Nnot that different...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:09.97,Flashback Top,Luke,0,0,0,,Let me cut people!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:11.21,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,You're really something, Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.97,0:02:12.40,Flashback Top,Luke,0,0,0,,Let me cut them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:12.40,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:13.65,Flashback,Ansem,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:20.98,Flashback Top,Luke,0,0,0,,I want to cut them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:15.48,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Afterward,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:21.85,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,these dangerous relics were fortunately \Nturned into training gear for Luke and Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:50.90,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:52.67,Default,Lucia,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:55.41,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This is a purchase order.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:56.52,Default,Lucia,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:02:59.04,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"The Mysterious Mask Wants to Fight."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:59.53,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 04
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:59.53,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}The Mysterious Mask Wants to Fight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:18.01,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:35.54,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,The White Wolf's Den is a maze made up of \Nnarrow passageways that keep branching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.15,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I just found out about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:39.75,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but in short...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:41.98,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,No matter how much you walk,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:44.72,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,everything looks the same, \Nso you never know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:49.20,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,And why the hell am I taking point, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.20,0:03:51.91,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Tino and Rhuda are the thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:54.01,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Why doesn't one of them take point?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:03.28,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She won't even look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:04.80,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Does Tino hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:07.69,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I don't even want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.69,0:04:09.12,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Please die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.69,0:04:11.93,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Is that what's she's thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:13.98,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Even though she liked me so much before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:16.59,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Maybe I should've gotten on my \Nknees and apologized first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:17.42,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:21.06,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,My apologies if this is \Nall according to plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:23.69,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,but where exactly are we headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.98,0:04:25.22,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Toward the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:31.66,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Where else {\i0}but{\i1} the exit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:34.22,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Not sure if this is the right way, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:35.60,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:36.24,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:39.09,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Figuring out Master's plan \Nis part of the training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:42.25,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Also, we've been moving away\Nfrom the exit this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:42.84,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:43.74,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:46.13,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Since I checked a map before setting out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:49.09,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I have a rough idea of \Nthe layout of this den.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:52.57,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,No matter what we do, this path \Nwill never get us to the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:56.03,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,If we want to return, we've got \Nto go back to the boss chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.60,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:04:59.85,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:04.86,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Wait, so were those big wolf \Nthings earlier the bosses?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:08.57,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That explains why they looked so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.86,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Hey, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.88,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,I understand that this is \Nall part of our training,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:18.09,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,but could you at least tell \Nus where we're headed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.73,0:05:21.53,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'd love to know that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:24.87,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Why the hell is everyone \Nrelying on me, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.36,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Guess it's time we made a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:33.13,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.77,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:40.46,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:43.73,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Everything Master does, he does for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:45.22,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:46.03,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:56.25,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:57.96,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:01.04,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:04.03,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You guys actually saw them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:06.80,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hunters have such good eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:08.72,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:12.17,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Is that the party we're supposed to rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.03,0:06:15.80,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,I am Rudolph Davout, the party leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:17.95,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to rescue us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:20.28,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You can express your gratitude to Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:21.18,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:25.42,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,He's the one who figured \Neverything out and led us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:26.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.30,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This was all just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.31,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.31,0:06:31.61,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Why would he say that himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:33.70,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,That makes him even more inscrutable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.98,0:06:36.31,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,I gave them some potions,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:39.13,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,but their energy is completely depleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.75,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,They need to eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:41.72,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:42.96,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I've got {\i1}that{\i0} thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:43.97,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.67,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.80,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,Master is a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:55.72,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,There's plenty more,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:58.22,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,so eat as many as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:07:00.36,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:02.85,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:05.44,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,Master really is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:08.85,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,Not only did he save our worthless hides,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:12.36,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,he also found the lost party with such ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:16.05,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,But what's more impressive \Nis his ability to calm everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:17.86,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,in this tense situation with his antics.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:20.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Tino.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.57,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Go on. Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.57,0:07:24.54,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.00,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,He's a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:28.81,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,I'm glad everyone is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:32.26,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,When I'd heard that everyone in \Nthe missing party was level 5,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:35.00,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,I was sure it must have\Nbeen some kind of mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:38.38,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,We weren't prepared, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:41.40,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,We never expected the \Nenemy to be that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:43.22,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:46.35,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Those wolf knights were pretty strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:50.05,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,but I wouldn't have expected them to \Ncompletely dominate a level 5 party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:51.39,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:51.97,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.20,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,With their faces half-covered by bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:56.40,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,No. Not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:59.75,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,The thing that got us was a single enemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:04.10,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,A small phantom with its \Nentire face covered by a skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:07.97,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,That thing is hatred incarnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:32.50,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,That phantom is probably the manifestation \Nof the lingering curse of the Silver Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:36.03,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,After the humans exterminated \Nthe wolf monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.03,0:08:40.72,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,their hatred swelled inside the treasure \Nvault and turned into this incredible power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:45.53,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Otherwise, that amount of power... \Nsimply can't be explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:48.79,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,We are confident in our abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:53.18,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,but we stood absolutely no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:55.09,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:06.39,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,It was on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:08.29,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,It was so strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:11.64,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,it might even be on the \Nlevel of Thousand Swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:13.91,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Did you just say Thousand Swords?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:17.40,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,You mean the capital's \Nstrongest swordsman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:19.49,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Thousand Swords, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.86,0:09:22.87,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,As the Sword Saint's apprentice, he got \Nhis education in proper swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:26.42,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Using that as the foundation, he went on to \Nlearn all manner of sword fighting styles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:31.17,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,He's a complete sword nerd who can cut down \Nany enemy with a single wooden sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:36.42,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,There's no need to hide it: he's my \Nchildhood friend and a member of the Grievers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:39.13,Top,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Luke Sykol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:41.81,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(527,1)\bord2\fs15\pos(153.079,206.905)}"Thousand Swords"\N{\u1\fs20}Luke Sykol{\fs15\u0}\NHunter Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:41.81,Flashback Top,Luke,0,0,0,,I want to cut people!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:45.20,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm sure this "hatred \Nincarnate" is really strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:48.45,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but saying it's on the level of \NThousand Swords is a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:52.88,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If such a phantom existed, Luke would \Nhave come and cut it down ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.31,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,But yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:09:56.85,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I don't think Tino can beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:59.81,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I knew I should've just waited for Ark!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.11,0:10:05.08,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Back then, the way it refused to finish us \Noff, you'd think it was toying with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:07.18,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Next time, it will kill us for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:10.25,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,What are you going to do, Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:12.86,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Um, why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:22.85,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Then it sounds like our only choice is to \Nget out of here before we encounter that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:26.21,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But the leader of this mission is Tino,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:27.70,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,so let's follow her orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:28.34,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:35.99,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,But compared to you, I'm complete garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:37.93,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This is also experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.95,0:10:40.86,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If it comes down to it, \NI'll be there to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:42.67,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Tino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:46.84,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I mean, taking point is \Nscary and such a drag!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.68,0:10:50.89,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:55.61,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I agree that we need to get out \Nof here as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:56.87,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:59.01,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,With you leading the way, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:00.29,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:03.62,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,My pain has subsided, \Nso now I can run properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:06.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:09.03,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But we also have the people we rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.03,0:11:10.35,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Let's not forget about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:11.03,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.03,0:11:13.24,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:14.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:17.74,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Of course, I'm the one who \Ncan't keep up whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:25.03,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Once we're through here, \Nwe'll almost be at the exit, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:27.07,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,I apologize for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:30.37,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Should that thing appear again,\Nyou can use me as a human shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:32.18,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I have no intention of abandoning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:34.34,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,I will buy you a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:39.05,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,So please, at least get \Nmy companions to safety. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:42.44,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,As long as we've got Master, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:44.30,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,All of us will return home alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:46.02,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,I am in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:47.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.39,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Her confidence in me is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:54.02,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If it were just Tino, \NI could pick her up and escape...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:56.81,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but doing that for everyone \Nhere is just not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.81,0:11:59.53,Default,Helian,0,0,0,,It's my job to be the human shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:03.41,Default,Helian,0,0,0,,Rudolph took this mission for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:04.78,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Don't say that, Helian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:08.18,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You can hash all that out \Nwhen this is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Once we're safely back in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:11.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.05,0:12:13.43,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Yes, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:14.43,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:15.86,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master is a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.31,0:12:22.98,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Are they getting closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.98,0:12:25.97,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,This {\i1}really{\i0} isn't my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:28.54,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I've got five Safety Rings left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:31.32,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Which means the sixth \Ntime, I really will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:34.47,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I've got no other relics I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:37.35,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,The Shooting Ring won't even stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:39.49,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,And Sitri's Slime is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:43.25,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Plus, I dropped the sword relic I \Nhad tied to my waist somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:44.75,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.40,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Could this really be the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:13:00.36,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Stay put over there, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:02.61,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:03.86,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:06.49,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Something tremendous is coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:09.17,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,It's that {\i1}thing{\i0}, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:14.98,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.64,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Stand back. This is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:20.14,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If I use the Night Hiker and \Nbecome a human missile,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:23.26,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'll die once, but I can at \Nleast get a surprise attack in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:26.41,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm so far gone that I'm calm again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:29.69,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:30.67,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:31.67,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.04,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,What the hell {\i1}is{\i0} that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:42.04,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:45.58,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,There's no way we can win \Nagainst something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.19,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,A second one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:54.69,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Preposterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:56.11,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:57.43,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:13:59.10,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Save us, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:00.93,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:01.85,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.85,0:14:05.61,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'll try my hardest and do anything! \NJust save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:08.22,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:11.21,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:21.28,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Liz, ain't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:25.73,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:27.62,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:30.05,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm just asking to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:32.05,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,When did she...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.05,0:14:35.21,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Are those new members for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:36.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:39.09,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Also, want to take off that mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.87,0:14:42.68,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:46.04,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I figured they weren't, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.41,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, you dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:50.27,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,This relic is yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:52.09,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:53.87,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:54.93,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Is she... human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:56.08,Default,Rudolph,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:57.61,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.61,0:15:00.34,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Are you saying you don't know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:02.84,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Even though Krai's here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:04.95,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Are you even hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:05.97,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Or unregistered?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:12.35,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me that \Nthere are people in the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.35,0:15:15.72,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,who don't know about the Grieving Souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:18.05,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.05,0:15:19.12,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:22.35,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm really sad, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:25.22,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I actually ran home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:29.25,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,But then I heard you had \Ngone to a treasure vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:31.01,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,It makes me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:33.01,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,So very, very sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:36.00,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,And so ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:38.76,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You know, I actually had faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:41.45,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I was sure this had to \Nbe some kind of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:45.41,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,That surely, you're just the worrying type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.41,0:15:46.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:50.98,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,But I can't believe... \Nthat my very own apprentice...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:58.76,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,can't even handle cleaning up a bunch of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:01.24,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Umm, what do yo—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:06.02,Default,All,0,0,0,,Gilbert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:10.53,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You go die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:13.84,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Can you not see that I'm in \Nthe middle of an apology?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:14.56,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Potions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:15.99,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Throw everything you have on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:16.53,Top,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Gilbert, are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:18.82,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Say, Ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.99,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Am I just incompetent?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:23.21,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Or did you not get enough training?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:24.75,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Do you lack talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:26.06,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Were you slacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:30.76,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Or do you lack ambition?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.06,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Well? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:36.77,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:38.27,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Answer me, you piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:39.71,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You worthless pile of trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:42.88,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I don't remember raising you like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:46.25,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Everyone will hate me because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:48.34,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,If you don't have the drive, just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:51.28,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Go die in a ditch before you can \Ncause trouble for Krai again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.81,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Bite off your tongue and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:54.68,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm so weak and horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.64,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Please forgive me. \NPlease forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:58.82,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:02.32,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm not the one you should be apologizing to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:06.09,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Liz, Tino did a really great job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:09.41,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,She defeated phantoms and \Nmanaged the mission as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:10.60,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,She did really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:11.71,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,She did?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.34,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:13.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:16.32,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,And you've also gotten \Nso good at holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.32,0:17:17.33,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:18.71,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.23,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:22.84,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You kept insisting,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:25.47,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,so I learned how to stop right before...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:27.11,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:28.47,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Stop right before, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:31.00,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't know how much you actually stopped,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:31.00,Top,Greg,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,but you're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.89,0:17:35.82,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I caused all \Nthese problems, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:38.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:40.74,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Ti does have talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:43.71,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,All that's lacking is ambition, \Neffort, and willingness to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:47.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:49.10,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:49.76,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,That's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:57.70,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I am so pissed that we're being \Nunderestimated because of you, Ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.51,0:18:01.44,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,This is so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.63,0:18:43.94,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:50.07,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You think you can hit me \Nwith a measly gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:56.17,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I have long surpassed weapons you dragged \Nup from physical civilizations!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:57.73,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Ti!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:18:58.30,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:02.00,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you were actually afraid of \Nthis pathetically slow, wet noodle of a weapon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:05.45,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Are you trying to embarrass \Nme with your incompetence?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:07.84,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,With phantoms like these...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.92,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,you kill them in their armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:12.12,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Kill them from above!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:13.69,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Blow up their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:19.12,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Kill however you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:21.96,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,It's the most fun thing ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:32.16,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,With swords, you grab them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:33.14,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,divert them,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.14,0:19:33.86,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,or evade them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:36.00,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.96,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Just tell me what you're\Nhaving trouble with here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.56,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You know, smash them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.88,0:19:45.86,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,They can't hit you if you kill them first!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:48.09,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,They can't dodge if you hit them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.09,0:19:49.47,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Just do it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:51.16,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Put your life on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:52.95,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:55.87,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You got it, right, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:59.54,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You'd better start living faster,\N cuz you don't have time, Ti!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:01.51,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You gotta work 100 times harder than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:04.15,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,The gap between us is only\Nwidening, you slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.15,0:20:05.64,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,You sluggish moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:09.58,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Now she's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:11.01,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I feel so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:12.94,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,And I was feeling {\i1}good {\i0}before!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:13.93,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:18.90,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,A phantom on par with \NThousand Swords... was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:22.41,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Thousand Swords and Liz \Nkept going up against each other
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.41,0:20:24.33,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,and mutually improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:27.40,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That's how the Grievers became strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.74,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Me excluded, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:36.70,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Liz, have you calmed down now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:39.34,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,A little, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:45.69,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Liz Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:50.74,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She is faster than anyone \Nand anything in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:53.34,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Her godly speed won't even \Nleave a shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:56.93,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That's why her second name \Nis "Stifled Shadow."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.94,Sign,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\bord2\fs15\pos(159.079,206.905)}"Stifled Shadow"\N{\u1\fs20}Liz Smart{\fs15\u0}\NHunter Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.44,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm back, Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.86,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:06.94,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks can have \Nthe Purgatorial Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:08.78,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:10.44,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Isn't it important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:14.46,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I'm starting all over again with my old party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:17.04,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,Make sure you apologize properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:17.91,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.91,0:21:19.96,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,You all helped me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:22.25,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Please tell Thousand Tricks I said thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:23.80,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:28.72,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, I'm going to be catching \Nbullets like Stifled Shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:29.69,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:31.11,Default,Greg,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.11,0:21:32.16,Default,Rhuda,0,0,0,,Yeah, nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:33.23,Default,Gilbert,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.73,0:21:36.06,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,If you're trying to get as good as her,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.22,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,just a word of warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:41.73,Sign,txt,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\fs25\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur2\fnImpact\b0\3c&H000000&\pos(496.52,86.623)}- 6 years ago -
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:41.73,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,The Grievers' masks are custom-made...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.73,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I messed up the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:47.86,Flashback,Sitri,0,0,0,,With these, blinding attacks \Nwon't have an effect on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.86,0:21:50.62,Flashback,Luke,0,0,0,,Yeah, our faces are completely protected!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:53.42,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,If we can wear these and move as before,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.38,Flashback,Liz,0,0,0,,won't we get even stronger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:56.85,Flashback,Lucia,0,0,0,,That's our Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:57.62,Flashback,Ansem,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.53,0:22:02.49,Flashback Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I forgot to make eye holes...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:08.53,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.53,0:22:10.65,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.22,0:22:13.65,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.23,0:22:17.14,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'll just forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.97,0:22:20.60,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That's what I'll do. Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:44.61,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(437,355)}By: Liz & Ti
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:33.06,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Date, date, happy-happy date,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:34.49,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,going out with Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:36.61,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Today, I'm feeling good all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:38.78,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Uh, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.78,0:23:40.87,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Um... Ma'am...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.87,0:23:42.35,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Ti, you go train!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.35,0:23:43.38,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:44.43,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Next time, on {\i1}Let This Grieving Soul{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.43,0:23:44.98,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,...{\i1}Retire{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:49.89,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 05
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:49.89,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Leave Everything to Ark
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.98,0:23:45.95,Top,Liz,0,0,0,,Louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.95,0:23:46.79,Top,Tino,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:49.06,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Leave Everything to Ark."
